Hey Jevgeni,

please see responses in green below:

* What kind of data we could get with user’s consent?

{color:#36b37e}For this project it is recommended to base the processing on legitimate interest rather than on user’s consent.{color}

* What kind of data we could get without user’s consent?

{color:#36b37e}Scope of the data collected should be limited to the scope of the data set out in the user-facing privacy policy. Payment information covered by PCI -DSS should be out of scope. To avoid collecting any special categories of data (such as data related to heath) and data that cannot be classified, I’d recommend to avoid tracking information collected via free text fields (e.g. chats).{color}

* For how long we are ok to keep data?

{color:#36b37e}As collection of this information is not a regulatory requirement, there is no set retention period prescribed by law. The general GDPR rule should be applied here and the data should be processed only for the only be kept in a form that permits identification of the individual for no longer than is necessary for the purposes for which it was processed. So please analyse this from business perspective, what is the actual lifespan of this information, i.e. for how long this data is actually useful. After the purpose of the processing is no longer there, the data should be irrevocably deleted or anonymised.{color}

* Should we provide any sort of tooling for data access?

{color:#36b37e}Yes, as personal data is in scope here, under GDPR the access should be given on the ‘need to know basis' and the data shouldn’t be widely accessible.{color}

* What would be ok way to do sanitization - e.g. in memory only or some temporary storage also ok.

{color:#36b37e}There are no legal requirements in this area as long as proper security measures can be applied. Please confirm this point with InfoSec and proceed in accordance with their steer.{color}



Also, please note that this project likely requires more formal privacy analysis, i.e. data protection impact assessment. To deliver on this regulatory requirement, please fill in the form here: [https://www.cognitoforms.com/BoltTechnologyO%C3%9C/PreliminaryPrivacyRiskAssessment?v2|https://www.cognitoforms.com/BoltTechnologyO%C3%9C/PreliminaryPrivacyRiskAssessment?v2] and we will follow up with next steps.

