The [🚗 Rider reports incorrect marketing message|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360017818599--Rider-reports-incorrect-marketing-message] ([Beehive|https://beehive.bolt.eu/main/kb/articles/internal/360017818599]) article has been updated:

h3. {color:#36b37e}*Marketing message/campaign does not match the user's location*{color}

{color:#36b37e}Campaigns are limited for use in the country or city they are targeted at. The target location is not always determined by the user's current location but rather their activity on the platform. The location may have been targeted as:{color}

* {color:#36b37e}It’s the user’s {color}{color:#36b37e}_Home city_ {color}{color:#36b37e}(determined by user’s registration and activity) {color}
